@startuml A02-class-design
!pragma layout smetana
title A02 行为类图（已确认，2026-11-05）\n规则负责判定；协调器唯一提交状态
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam classBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
hide empty members
top to bottom direction

class UExperimentSubsystem <<已有 / 细化>> {
  - RunState : FExperimentRunState
  + NotifyActionUsed(FActionUsedFact)
  + NotifyAttackAtGoblin(FAttackDirectedAtGoblinFact)
  + NotifyThreatDiscovered(FThreatDiscoveredFact)
  + NotifyAftermathObserved(FAftermathObservedFact)
  + NotifyBatchSettled(FSettlementCompletedFact)
  + NotifySkipReady(FSkipReadyFact)
  + NotifyControlRestored(FPlayerControlRestoredFact)
  + NotifyRevisitContent(FRevisitContentFact)
  - CaptureMoment() : FExperimentMoment
  - CommitDecision(FExperimentFlowDecision)
}
class FExperimentFlowRules <<新增 / 纯 C++ / 无状态>> {
  {static} + EvaluateRescue(State, Snapshot) : Decision
  {static} + EvaluateRevisit(State) : Decision
  {static} + CanRestorePlayerControl(State) : bool
}
class FExperimentRunState <<USTRUCT / 已有细化>> {
  RunId / Phase / 观察进度
  剑术、魔法统计 / 锁定结果
  Timing / 跳时就绪 / 回访进度
}
class FEncounterSnapshot <<瞬时只读值>> {
  RunId / BatchId / 有效性
  玩家、小孩生死 / 威胁全灭
  必须完整且已稳定
}
class FExperimentFlowDecision <<值结果>> {
  RunId / ExpectedPhase / 触发标识
  继续 / 等待后果 / 跳时 / 结束
  原因 / 分支 / 诊断
}
class AExperimentWorldDirector <<已有 / 世界拥有>> {
  + RequestSettledSnapshot()
  + RequestEnvironmentSettlement(Token)
  + ApplyRevisit(Token)
  + RestorePlayerControl(Token)
  回报就绪及实际恢复时刻
}
class UExperimentLogWriter <<已有>> {
  + TryAppend(FExperimentResult)
}

UExperimentSubsystem *-down- "1" FExperimentRunState : 唯一拥有
UExperimentSubsystem ..> FExperimentFlowRules : 只读求值
FExperimentFlowRules ..> FExperimentRunState : 读取
FExperimentFlowRules ..> FEncounterSnapshot : 救援判定输入
FExperimentFlowRules ..> FExperimentFlowDecision : 返回
UExperimentSubsystem ..> FExperimentFlowDecision : 验证后提交
UExperimentSubsystem --> AExperimentWorldDirector : 弱引用 / 编排命令
AExperimentWorldDirector ..> FEncounterSnapshot : 提供已结算事实
UExperimentSubsystem *-- UExperimentLogWriter : 结束时提交结果

legend bottom
  仅新增一个行为类；规则类无状态，不拥有 Actor，也不直接执行副作用。
  Director 提供领域快照，不再保存另一套角色生命值。
  RunState 的时间与进度字段见配套数据图；继承关系沿用 A01。
endlegend
@enduml
